## Interface: 30300
## Title: Raid Recruiter
## Notes: Two tools for running a raid. Recruiting: posts your LFM message to the channels you pick on a timer and collects everyone who whispers you into a sortable applicant list with their item level, level and role. Loot rolls: puts a boss drop up for roll in /rw, tracks who rolled what, and hands the item to the winner. /rr
